mounts, which they do: $59 refund confirmed by tool and state. The terminal state is described without inventing facts.","record_type":"assertion_result","required":true,"schema_version":"v1alpha1","status":"pass"}],"case_id":"creator-seed-004","grade_id":"grade-run-creator-seed-audit-creator-seed-004-iteration-0","iteration_id":"iteration-0","record_type":"case_grade","run_id":"run-creator-seed-audit","schema_version":"v1alpha1","status":"pass"}